@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List products (copy an _id from the response into the next request)
GET {{base}}/api/products

### Add to cart as guest
POST {{base}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "PASTE_PRODUCT_ID", "quantity": 2 }

### View cart
GET {{base}}/api/cart

### Register (guest cart merges into your account)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "asha@example.com", "password": "password123", "name": "Asha" }

### Checkout
POST {{base}}/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "address": { "line1": "1 Main St", "city": "Hyderabad", "state": "TS", "pincode": "500001" } }

### My orders
GET {{base}}/api/orders
